   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I really like this graph being used to monitor application usage and am looking for the code / data format to reproduce it. <div><br></div><div>I&#39;m creating an internal dashboard to monitor usage by session$user so the end result would essentially be the same but with different series for each user we&#39;ve authenticated.<div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-eFZAgwb4rxg/WS3HCY3ZcoI/AAAAAAAAIOs/_ZAOXo7lqL4vt8gs3anukuK9a1rdCbJIgCLcB/s1600/LPV2H.png\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-eFZAgwb4rxg/WS3HCY3ZcoI/AAAAAAAAIOs/_ZAOXo7lqL4vt8gs3anukuK9a1rdCbJIgCLcB/s1600/LPV2H.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360928146000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3W0s37lPFNZYwf7-S5tgMT\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-eFZAgwb4rxg/WS3HCY3ZcoI/AAAAAAAAIOs/_ZAOXo7lqL4vt8gs3anukuK9a1rdCbJIgCLcB/s320/LPV2H.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"158\"></a></p><div><br><br><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>If anyone has a source on how to generally recreate this, I&#39;d really appreciate it! All credits to Rstudio of course.</div></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
